WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.301
This is a teaching lesson, not a live tornado.

00:00:03.301 --> 00:00:05.741
A tornado watch means be prepared.

00:00:05.741 --> 00:00:08.324
A tornado warning means take action.

00:00:08.324 --> 00:00:14.136
This lesson is set in a sturdy house with a basement, not a mobile home or a car.
